### [Breaking Through Peak Season Noise Report](https://mailchimp.com/resources/breaking-through-peak-season-noise/)

**Summary**: Mailchimp's Holiday Lookback Report analyzes over 44 billion emails and 83 million text messages sent during the 2025 peak shopping season (Halloween through New Year's Eve) to identify what let brands generate $1B+ in revenue while cutting through BFCM marketing noise. The throughline: brands using intelligent marketing — AI and automation to segment and personalize at scale — outperformed brands still sending one-size-fits-all blasts.

**Key Points**:
- Segmented, personalized BFCM emails drove 11% higher average order value than non-personalized sends ($166 vs. $150), yet fewer than 6% of the 44+ billion peak-season emails used personalization.
